 abstract = {Summary <p>Augmented reality (AR) is a technically augmented depiction that mimics the actual surroundings that exists from the incorporation of computerized visual, auditory, and other different sensory inputs. It is one of the key innovations of Industry 4.0, ranks as one of the greatest intriguing as well as facilitating technologies for facilitating manufacturing facilities. Artificial intelligence (AI) techniques are making remarkable strides and are currently being used in many different industries. The next big development in the next years will be the merging of AR with AI, as numerous industries and educational establishments realize how important this integration is. In the years ahead, computers will become affordable, more effective, plus energy optimized. This serves as an important catalyst and prerequisite for growth in AR, so with the backing of AI, it is feasible. Smart businesses have a great opportunity to boost production speed and staff training, as well as improve manufacturing, error management, assembly, and packing. We present a thorough assessment of current achievements in addition to platforms of AI&#x2010;powered AR, as well as the complications of smearing AI in AR usages. It is going to function as a foundation for forthcoming research on AR using AI support in industries.</p>},
